-- What two circulars of one subject (pairs that no family's module holds) print in the same words (MMS-775):
-- each such declaration is declared here once and imported by every circular
-- that prints it. A circular cites the rows a declaration encodes in a note
-- where the declaration stood; above each one here is where it is printed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- circular תשס"ז/1 and circular תשס"ט/2
`given or empty` MEANS LIST "x", ""

-- circular תשס"ז/4 and circular תשס"ח/2
`grant rate`         MEANS 3.5%

-- circular תשס"ח/7 and circular תשס"ט/1
`the individual-hour supplement rate` MEANS 4.5%

-- circular תשס"ט/4 and circular תשפ"ה/10
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the class-size share` pupils IS
    BRANCH IF pupils AT LEAST 10 THEN 1
           IF pupils AT LEAST 6  THEN 50%
           IF pupils AT LEAST 1  THEN 25%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- circular תשע"ב/4 and circular תשע"ב/10
`grades checked` MEANS range 7 14

-- circular תשע"ג/9 and circular תשע"ג/10
`31 December 2014` MEANS 20141231

-- circular תשע"ח/1 and circular תשע"ט/7
`the further update of 1.12.2018` MEANS 0.012

-- circular תש"ף/5 and circular תש"ף/7
`the last day the Public Health Order bars gatherings` MEANS Date 18 4 2020
